  "decisions": [
    "Trusted host grants an actor-scoped semantic milestone; award and level-up are separate persisted commands.",
    "Only Soldier 1-to-2, fixed-average d10 base 6, and the exact two level-2 Base cards Defensive Positioning and Tactical Reposition are supported.",
    "Level-up preserves current HP/resources/status except downward max-HP clamp; adds one unspent Hit Die and leaves prior Hit Dice unchanged.",
    "Tactical Reposition is restricted to the actor own regular tactical turn; it consumes Bonus Action at commitment, has Recharge 2, a separate half-Speed route budget, suppresses OAs but keeps Press, and refreshes on the actor regular starts.",
    "Defensive Positioning uses an explicit adjacent prototype cover marker; general terrain/cover is not implemented."
  ],
